{
  "id": "JHN.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 12",
  "verseCount": 46,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu geayeasha nagheeda aba Betaniya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwashoada eawooji lah aba hiteayda ghweelmeeda Basaaka, ghwahita Yesu Betaniya heeda ghayi abiita Lasarooyda aduuna Yesu miyeedean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geesissa hamiteaba shing'ada; hean gagadiiyeesa Marta nea Lasaro abeeda gaba jeeda fuga ambuuchi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Mariya nagheeda ng'andit siguura nardo mida gideeshteayda siyiin buureata biissa gaba sheayeeda haw, ak ghwayeasha geeshanga Yesu ak goobuusa buudeagaaschi; gang'andiit gheesean aba shearooda nagheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yudayda Iskariyote bea jeeda ginealangaaschi (was dea jea ghwalabwadaw niny), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghwasaan anda ghwanyawa nagheani meeshaaydaawana dinaaraji bughalaji samwagu ak geelakiisa fuga barbari?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanyaashtunu aba beadi samsa fuga barbari, gweagu gideaba niny mareanghweanda, eawoojisu iissa goodiiwi sandakooda lapiya nea iissa eawoojisu gwajagwadi lapiyeeda mida jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu ak gwayeesha, “Anung'waada gwandeawa, ghoamuughu eaweeda jea eepunyanean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga barbari gajandeawana galeagasean, duuku aniini ea majeendeayeena galeagasean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geamwaal gichea eenuusta Lasaro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nal eemeetuw bea Yahudi gideaba gwanda hoowa, ghapka nea mwaada gideaba gagasa ghwadaah Yesu, gagasa ghwadaah eara Lasarooyda heeta siituuna miyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamwaal Ashoohoodiga hees gichea eenuusta eara Lasaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gweagu gideaba aba badaydaanyi gooheeli geat fuga saang'a bea Yahudi ak ghamwas Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hooseaneega aba hiteayda Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghwayiiy eemeetuw buwa ghweelmeeda gideaba Yesu gwanda naweeda ghwaan Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwahirjeawi damealga miilayga ak gaweay roonyeeda nea goojuur muuchi nea gwayi, “Hoosaana! Sing'usha siisi wuna gheawunga Ng'utamiidean, eara sugoocheanda Israeli!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanyas Yesu gureenda ak gwading'da badayda gawuurji gissing'oarda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ginealangaaschi ea mii gwajeeng'u ng'asheesu aba mwadi; iidu nea siikghaambiit Yesu, hean ghoapkaat gideaba ng'asheesu geang'waar aba badaydaanyi ea gideaba sisissa buuneeda ng'asheesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gamuuwu eemeeda heeta mideayi sea niny eaweeda guursiina Lasaro gwarina jeeda bung'eeda ak gooduudu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghoah giteaptaawa eemeeda aba gideaba nisin gwadeagoani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaba Farisaayajeanji eesha niirja, “Moadaahi gideaba moamuusi asina gil; oang'wearda, ghwaat geeshta ng'eanyiida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga mwaatkwa bea Yunani gaseadayi Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba jeeda fuga weay ghadooweeda eaweeda ghweelmeeda gwanda fuga mwaatkwa bea Yunani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay Fiisu heeda Filipoheeda leabu Betsaydeeda Galilaya ak gwayeesha niny, “Siida mureeda, geegasayi eadaaha Yesu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Filipo ak gwarukusa Andreya; ak goodeayi Andreya sea Filipo ak gwarukusa Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Nihita damanda jea eekghaambiida Orjeeda Siida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa, aba huumwa, geayeeshiineegwa, gheang'nyeanda ngaano iissa goobiida damwanagi ea eaghus goobissa jeesigeeda ak ghami. Iing'ata miyeeda gwaji haghweega saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida bwariiy eaweagaaschi gaygwalaku, nea siida sit eaweagaaschi aba badaydeaba ng'eanyiini gayghoaghu ea gagul eaweega manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida jea gwasinnean gadiyeeda geaghus gweadu geeshteanyu; ak abeeda heeda eandi aniini eara soomjeandeanyu gaygwanda eara niny; siida jea gwasinnean gadiyeeda abeeda gaygwasissa Bwaabwa mureeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabaloola iita miyeadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghamneawa guroroodeanyu ning'ut muuwda. Ak gaydayiin? ‘Bwaabwa, lealnean aba damani’? Manda, aba badaydeaba ng'asheanji naahidu damani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwaabwa aghaambiida gheawungaagu.” Deagheata ghwanya ghuuta nyaasha humng'eeda nea gwayi, “Naaghaambiichi, ak gaydabiikta daaghaambiit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiiy eemeeda ghwanyawa miinaada aba hoowa ghuutida ak gwayi mwaatkwa, ghoaghweandan humng'eeda. Nea gwayi mwaatkwa, “Goobalool malaykajeanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yesu nea gwayeesha, “Ghuudi oayiinyiin mwanya aba badaydeanyu aniini, ghwanya aba badahuukeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani nihita heeda jea eergweaksiina ng'eanyiini, nihita damanda jea eejakteawa siida ahaaghwa ng'eanyiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aniini iisiitiing'danean humng'eeda daheeli ng'eanyiida, gaydaksu buuneesean ghapka heedeanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba rukunoodeaba ng'asheanji ghoahiimu miyeeda jea ghami giduurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha eemeeda ak gwayeesha, “Aseasa gwarukuneasa deaweeda gideaba Gristo gayghwashng'u eaweega manda muudeanooda. Abeeda ghoamuustiin gideaba gajayeena Orjeeda siida gajeetiing'da humng'eeda? Orjeeni bea siidean ng'eaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Gudandeawana weeshinda gheadi nuwaas. Aneayeena hiji duu andeawana weeshindean ea majooreagwa misaneeda; siida neayeewa jeeda misaneeda mwanala eara heeda gal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi hiji duu andeawana weeshindean amwasa weeshinda, ak ghoahuuyi diibiga weeshinda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga mandeawana masaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata rukunoodeaba ng'asheesu ghang'eat Yesu gooheeli geaw ak gawa ghafunya geaw saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi nisin gwadeagwajeega saang'a aba madeanyaawaan, saawa ghanyea meamwasa niny; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwasa ng'asheega rugu sibaneeda siguura Isaya nea gwayi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega Yesu goorgweaksa buuneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabalool Yesu aba ghuuta haw nea gwayi, “Siida mwasan aniini mamwasaan nea gabwageaw, ghamwas dea ajeaknean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida nidaahan aniini abeeda nidaah dea ajeaknean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini ghaawunyi nea geawooschi weeshinda ng'eanyiida, ak abeeda siida mwasan ea meabiidana jeeda misaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida iiy ng'asheegeasu ak ea moang'waanya, aniini maydeargweaksa; aba gideaba mwaawuni deargweaksa ng'eanyiida ghaawunyi dalealu ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida jaktanean nea moang'waanya ng'asheegeasu gwandeawa dea jea goorgweaksa; ng'asheandida earguun dea jea goorgweaksa gil eaweeda huuydean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini meabalooli aba gheambalmeedeanyu; aniini geaghus gearugu Bwaabeeda ajeaknean dea goonan diigheanda gil ea gichea dabaloola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaanali gideaba diigheandaanyi eaweega manda muudeanooda. Asi aniini gearugu ng'asheega eeshean Bwaabwa rukuta.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
